File: emacsvox.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-planner,  Next: emacsvox-aural-preview,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-overrides,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

12.28 emacsvox-aural-planner
============================

Infer presentation objects and formatting runs from captured source
text, resolve semantic policy once at the source boundary, and attach
frozen concrete plans.  This module performs no queueing or backend
process work.


File: emacsvox.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-preview,  Next: emacsvox-aural-profile-service,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-planner,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

12.29 emacsvox-aural-preview
============================

Coordinate explicit previews without owning their feature-specific
content.  Speech previews stop earlier output, queue one concrete plan
or caller-built sequence, and dispatch once.  Cue-only previews stop
speech but bypass the speech queue, presentation history, and training
hooks.


File: emacsvox.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-profile-service,  Next: emacsvox-aural-profiles,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-preview,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

12.30 emacsvox-aural-profile-service
====================================

Stable non-UI operations over presentation-profile state.  Profile
managers and diagnostics depend on this service rather than each other's
private functions.


