12.39 emacsvox-aural-resources
==============================

Register semantic cue and tone names, sound resource packs, module
resource overlays, requirement profiles, and device-independent voice
palettes.  Resource resolution remains independent of local-player and
speech-server protocols.

12.39.1 Emacsvox-Aural-Resources Commands
-----------------------------------------

12.39.1.1 emacsvox-aural-refresh-discovered-resource-packs
..........................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-aural-refresh-discovered-resource-packs

     Rescan configured discovery roots and return discovered pack identifiers.

12.39.2 emacsvox-aural-resources Options
----------------------------------------

 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-aural-disabled-resource-overlays
     Module resource overlays that should use their generic cue fallbacks.

     Disabling an overlay suppresses both its packaged defaults and matching
     themed overrides below an active sound pack.

     Default Value:

     nil


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-aural-personal-sound-packs-directory
     Directory containing personal sound packs.

     Each immediate child is a candidate pack.  Set this to nil to disable the
     standard personal discovery root.  The directory need not exist.

     Default Value:

     "~/.emacsvox/sounds/packs/"



File: emacsvox.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-routing-profiles,  Next: emacsvox-aural-rules,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-resources,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

12.40 emacsvox-aural-routing-profiles
=====================================

Store physical-engine routing separately from portable ACSS voice
palettes.  Property selectors can travel between machines, exact native
identifiers require explicit local scope, and session selectors are
never persisted.

12.40.1 emacsvox-aural-routing-profiles Options
-----------------------------------------------

 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-aural-routing-profiles-file
     Data-only file containing machine-local voice routing profiles.

     This file is deliberately separate from portable voice palettes.  It may
     contain explicitly local physical voice IDs and should not be synchronized
     unless the user has reviewed those bindings.

     Default Value:

     "~/.emacsvox/aural-routing-profiles.el"



File: emacsvox.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-rules,  Next: emacsvox-aural-schemes,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-routing-profiles,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

12.41 emacsvox-aural-rules
==========================

Compile safe versioned presentation rule sets into validated internal
structures, match them against semantic facts and source context, and
produce an ordered backend-independent render plan.  The retained
internal scheme records are not user-selectable configurations.  This
module performs no audio or speech I/O.


File: emacsvox.info,  Node: emacsvox-aural-schemes,  Next: emacsvox-aural-semantics,  Prev: emacsvox-aural-rules,  Up: Emacsvox Commands And Options

12.42 emacsvox-aural-schemes
============================

Register and inherit internal declarative rule sets, combine module,
Presentation Option, personal, session, and buffer layers, preserve
legacy personality hints, and persist user data without evaluating it.
Public configuration no longer exposes a selectable scheme layer;
historical scheme names remain in the data model and compatibility
filename.

12.42.1 emacsvox-aural-schemes Options
--------------------------------------

 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-aural-schemes-file
     Data-only file containing personal aural presentation settings.

     Default Value:

     "~/.emacsvox/aural-schemes.el"



